WEBVTT

00:02.258 --> 00:04.427
KATARA: Water.

00:04.844 --> 00:06.304
Earth.

00:06.596 --> 00:08.598
Fire.

00:08.890 --> 00:10.308
Air.

00:11.142 --> 00:15.104
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.438 --> 00:19.275
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.776 --> 00:22.403
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.529 --> 00:23.738
could stop them.

00:23.863 --> 00:26.699
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:27.367 --> 00:29.494
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

00:29.577 --> 00:32.664
the new Avatar, an airbender named Aang.

00:32.956 --> 00:35.166
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.291 --> 00:37.585
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.710 --> 00:38.920
AANG: Oof!

00:39.045 --> 00:42.006
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:02.361 --> 01:04.613
More ferocious!

01:04.738 --> 01:06.365
Imagine striking through
your opponent's heart.

01:07.866 --> 01:09.743
( GROANS ) I'm trying.

01:09.868 --> 01:12.537
Now, let me hear you roar
like a tiger-dillo!

01:12.621 --> 01:14.373
( ROARS WEAKLY )

01:14.665 --> 01:16.416
That sounded pathetic.

01:16.792 --> 01:18.126
I said, roar!

01:19.086 --> 01:22.089
( ROARING )

01:22.422 --> 01:24.675
( CHATTERING )

01:25.884 --> 01:29.304
Who wants a nice cool
glass of watermelon juice?

01:29.429 --> 01:31.056
Ooh, ooh, me, me, me!

01:31.181 --> 01:34.685
Hey, your lesson's not over yet!
Get back here!

01:34.810 --> 01:36.812
Come on, Zuko, just take a break.

01:36.895 --> 01:38.105
What's the big deal?

01:38.522 --> 01:40.065
Fine.

01:40.816 --> 01:42.442
If you wanna lounge around

01:42.567 --> 01:44.653
like a bunch of snail sloths
all day, then go ahead!

01:44.778 --> 01:46.989
- AANG: ( SLURPING )
- Maybe Zuko's right.

01:47.072 --> 01:49.199
Sitting around the house
has made us pretty lazy.

01:49.449 --> 01:51.535
But I know just the thing to change that―

01:51.827 --> 01:53.662
Beach party!

02:13.890 --> 02:15.392
Check out my Appa sand-sculpture.

02:15.517 --> 02:16.727
( BELLOWS )

02:16.852 --> 02:18.854
Not, bad baldy.

02:18.979 --> 02:21.106
But I've been working on my sandbending.

02:21.231 --> 02:22.524
You're gonna love this.

02:28.071 --> 02:29.865
Whoa!

02:29.990 --> 02:33.035
Wow, you even made a little
Earth King and Bosco.

02:35.537 --> 02:37.247
Try and top that, Sokka.

02:38.957 --> 02:40.292
Ta-da!

02:40.417 --> 02:43.670
AANG: Is that a blubbering blob-monster?

02:43.795 --> 02:45.297
No, it's Suki!

02:45.630 --> 02:48.759
BOTH: ( LAUGHING )

02:49.092 --> 02:50.427
Suki, we'll all understand

02:50.552 --> 02:52.429
if you break with him up over this.

02:52.554 --> 02:54.514
I think it's sweet.

02:55.766 --> 02:57.225
But it doesn't even look like―

02:57.309 --> 02:58.477
( SCREAMS )

03:11.281 --> 03:12.657
What are you doing?

03:14.534 --> 03:16.745
Teaching you a lesson.

03:31.093 --> 03:32.594
What happened?

03:32.719 --> 03:34.304
Zuko's gone crazy!

03:34.388 --> 03:36.890
I made a sand sculpture
of Suki and he destroyed it!

03:38.642 --> 03:40.519
Oh, and he's attacking Aang.

03:59.204 --> 04:01.706
Get a grip before I blast
you off this roof!

04:02.124 --> 04:03.667
Go ahead and do it.

04:36.616 --> 04:37.826
Enough!

04:41.538 --> 04:42.998
( WOOD SPLINTERING )

04:43.123 --> 04:44.875
ZUKO: ( GRUNTING )

04:45.000 --> 04:46.334
( GROANS )

04:47.627 --> 04:49.629
What's wrong with you?
You could have hurt Aang.

04:49.713 --> 04:50.881
What's wrong with me?

04:51.173 --> 04:52.924
What's wrong with all of you?

04:53.049 --> 04:54.593
How can you sit around
having beach parties

04:54.676 --> 04:57.095
when Sozin's comet
is only three days away?

04:59.639 --> 05:01.766
Why are you all looking
at me like I'm crazy?

05:01.892 --> 05:03.810
About Sozin's comet―

05:03.935 --> 05:05.854
I was actually gonna
wait to fight the Fire Lord

05:05.979 --> 05:07.397
until after it came.

05:07.481 --> 05:08.565
After?

05:08.690 --> 05:09.858
I'm not ready.

05:09.983 --> 05:12.194
I need more time to master firebending.

05:12.319 --> 05:14.279
And, frankly, your earthbending

05:14.404 --> 05:15.572
could still use some work, too.

05:15.989 --> 05:18.366
So, you all knew Aang was gonna wait?

05:18.825 --> 05:21.578
Honestly, if Aang tries to
fight the Fire Lord right now,

05:21.703 --> 05:22.996
he's gonna lose.

05:23.121 --> 05:24.247
No offense.

05:24.372 --> 05:27.209
The whole point of fighting the Fire Lord
before the comet

05:27.334 --> 05:29.294
was to stop the Fire Nation
from winning the war.

05:29.419 --> 05:32.172
But they pretty much won the war
when they took Ba Sing Se.

05:32.339 --> 05:34.549
Things can't get any worse.

05:34.883 --> 05:37.093
You're wrong.

05:37.219 --> 05:39.721
It's about to get worse
than you can even imagine.

05:40.222 --> 05:42.015
The day before the eclipse,

05:42.098 --> 05:44.809
my father asked me to attend
an important war meeting.

05:44.935 --> 05:47.979
It was what I'd dreamed about
and wanted for so many years.

05:48.104 --> 05:49.856
My father had finally accepted me back.

05:53.777 --> 05:55.779
OZAI: Welcome, Prince Zuko.

05:55.904 --> 05:57.572
We waited for you.

06:05.163 --> 06:07.499
General Shinu, your report.

06:07.832 --> 06:09.668
Thank you, sir.

06:09.751 --> 06:12.796
Ba Sing Se is still under our control,

06:12.921 --> 06:15.715
however, earthbender
rebellions have prevented us

06:15.840 --> 06:18.843
from achieving total victory
in the Earth Kingdom.

06:18.927 --> 06:20.679
What is your recommendation?

06:20.845 --> 06:22.764
Our army is spread too thin,

06:22.889 --> 06:25.850
but once the eclipse is over,
and the invasion defeated,

06:25.976 --> 06:29.688
we should transfer more domestic
forces into the Earth Kingdom.

06:29.813 --> 06:31.273
Mmm...

06:31.356 --> 06:34.568
Prince Zuko, you've been among
the Earth Kingdom commoners.

06:34.901 --> 06:36.861
Do you think that adding more troops

06:36.945 --> 06:38.363
will stop these rebellions?

06:40.615 --> 06:43.827
The people of the Earth Kingdom
are proud and strong.

06:43.952 --> 06:47.789
They can endure anything
as long as they have hope.

06:47.914 --> 06:49.374
Yes, you're right.

06:51.042 --> 06:53.795
We need to destroy their hope.

06:54.296 --> 06:56.214
Well, that's not exactly what I―

06:56.339 --> 06:58.466
I think you should take
their precious hope,

06:58.592 --> 07:02.679
and the rest of their land
and burn it all to the ground.

07:02.804 --> 07:06.683
Yes, yes, you're right Azula.

07:06.808 --> 07:09.519
Sozin's comet is almost upon us,

07:09.603 --> 07:11.605
and on that day, it will endow us

07:11.730 --> 07:14.482
with the strength
and power of a hundred suns.

07:14.858 --> 07:17.235
No bender will stand a chance against us.

07:17.485 --> 07:19.696
What are you suggesting, sir?

07:20.030 --> 07:24.367
When the comet last came,
my grandfather, Fire Lord Sozin,

07:24.451 --> 07:26.578
used it to wipe out the Air Nomads.

07:26.786 --> 07:30.457
Now, I will use its power
to end the Earth Kingdom...

07:30.915 --> 07:32.375
Permanently!

07:33.752 --> 07:37.422
From our airships we will
rain fire over their lands,

07:37.547 --> 07:40.967
a fire that will destroy everything,

07:41.092 --> 07:44.638
and out of the ashes,
a new world will be born.

07:44.763 --> 07:47.641
A world in which all
the lands are Fire Nation,

07:47.724 --> 07:52.103
and I am the supreme ruler of everything!

07:52.312 --> 07:53.605
ALL: ( APPLAUDING )

07:53.688 --> 07:56.733
ZUKO: I wanted to speak out
against this horrifying plan,

07:56.816 --> 07:58.652
but I'm ashamed to say I didn't.

07:59.569 --> 08:00.695
My whole life, I've struggled

08:00.820 --> 08:03.239
to gain my father's love and acceptance.

08:03.365 --> 08:04.783
But once I had it,

08:04.908 --> 08:07.744
I realized I'd lost myself getting there.

08:07.869 --> 08:10.413
I'd forgotten who I was.

08:10.538 --> 08:12.916
I can't believe this.

08:13.041 --> 08:15.418
I always knew the Fire Lord was a bad guy.

08:15.543 --> 08:18.755
But his plan is just pure evil.

08:19.089 --> 08:20.882
What am I gonna do?

08:21.007 --> 08:22.759
I know you're scared.

08:22.884 --> 08:25.220
And I know you're not
ready to save the world.

08:25.512 --> 08:28.598
But if you don't defeat the
Fire Lord before the comet comes,

08:28.682 --> 08:30.809
there won't be a world to save anymore.

08:37.857 --> 08:40.735
Why didn't you tell me about
your dad's crazy plan sooner?

08:40.860 --> 08:42.404
I didn't think I had to.

08:42.529 --> 08:44.614
I assumed you were still gonna
fight him before the comet.

08:44.739 --> 08:47.200
No one told me you decided to wait.

08:47.325 --> 08:48.660
This is bad.

08:48.785 --> 08:51.162
This is really, really bad.

08:51.287 --> 08:54.374
Aang, you don't have to do this alone.

08:54.499 --> 08:56.960
Yeah, if we all fight
the Fire Lord together,

08:57.085 --> 08:58.753
we've got a shot at taking him down.

08:59.003 --> 09:01.506
All right! Team Avatar is back!

09:01.631 --> 09:02.757
Air.

09:02.882 --> 09:04.008
Water.

09:04.092 --> 09:05.093
Earth.

09:05.176 --> 09:06.177
Fire.

09:06.511 --> 09:08.430
Fan and sword.

09:09.723 --> 09:11.266
Fighting the Fire Lord

09:11.391 --> 09:13.435
is gonna be the hardest thing
we've ever done together.

09:13.560 --> 09:15.812
But I wouldn't wanna do it any other way.

09:15.937 --> 09:17.647
ALL EXCEPT ZUKO: ( LAUGHING )

09:17.772 --> 09:19.774
- Yeah.
- All right.

09:19.899 --> 09:21.443
Get over here, Zuko.

09:21.568 --> 09:25.113
Being part of the group
also means being part of group hugs.

09:28.992 --> 09:30.577
( BELLOWING )

09:30.702 --> 09:31.995
( THUDS )

09:33.830 --> 09:35.123
ZUKO: There is one technique
you need to know

09:35.206 --> 09:36.666
before facing my father...

09:37.375 --> 09:38.960
How to redirect lightning.

09:40.420 --> 09:42.839
If you let the energy
in your own body flow,

09:42.964 --> 09:44.382
the lightning will follow it.

09:44.507 --> 09:46.926
You turn your opponents'
energy against them.

09:47.177 --> 09:49.471
- That's like waterbending.
- Exactly.

09:49.596 --> 09:51.556
My uncle invented this technique himself

09:51.639 --> 09:52.807
by studying waterbenders.

09:53.266 --> 09:56.436
So, have you ever
redirected lightning before?

09:56.561 --> 09:57.687
Once...

09:57.812 --> 09:59.022
Against my father.

09:59.147 --> 10:00.398
What did it feel like?

10:01.191 --> 10:02.192
Exhilarating.

10:02.317 --> 10:05.069
( ELECTRICITY ZAPPING )

10:05.153 --> 10:06.404
But terrifying.

10:06.905 --> 10:08.239
( EXPLOSION )

10:09.657 --> 10:12.869
You feel so powerful holding
that much energy in your body,

10:12.994 --> 10:16.372
but you know if you make
the wrong move... It's over.

10:16.498 --> 10:19.626
( LAUGHS ) Well, not over-over.

10:19.751 --> 10:21.419
I mean, there is always Katara

10:21.544 --> 10:24.047
and a little spirit water action,
am I right?

10:24.339 --> 10:27.300
Actually, I used it all up
after Azula shot you.

10:27.842 --> 10:28.885
Oh.

10:29.052 --> 10:32.806
You'll have to take Fire Lord's
life before he takes yours.

10:34.349 --> 10:36.851
Yeah, I'll just do that.

10:43.024 --> 10:44.859
SOKKA: Gather around, Team Avatar.

10:47.028 --> 10:48.738
In order to take out the Fire Lord,

10:48.863 --> 10:50.573
or, in this case, the Melon Lord,

10:50.698 --> 10:52.784
our timing has to be perfect.

10:52.909 --> 10:55.286
First, Suki and I will draw his fire.

10:55.411 --> 10:58.998
Then Katara and Zuko charge in
with some liquidy hot offense,

10:59.123 --> 11:01.000
and while the Melon Lord is distracted,

11:01.125 --> 11:05.213
Aang swoops in and... Bam!
He delivers the final blow.

11:05.338 --> 11:07.382
Uh, what about me?

11:07.507 --> 11:09.384
For now, you're the Melon Lord's forces.

11:09.509 --> 11:12.053
So, I get to chuck
flaming rocks at all of you?

11:12.178 --> 11:14.305
Whatever makes the training
feel more realistic.

11:15.223 --> 11:16.474
Sweetness.

11:17.267 --> 11:19.727
Mwa-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

11:33.241 --> 11:34.659
( RUMBLING )

11:43.543 --> 11:46.379
( FLAMES CRACKLING )

11:46.504 --> 11:47.881
Watch it, Toph!

11:48.006 --> 11:51.342
I am not Toph, I am Melon Lord!

11:51.467 --> 11:53.511
Mwa-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

12:07.692 --> 12:08.693
Now, Aang!

12:19.829 --> 12:21.956
What are you waiting for? Take him out!

12:22.081 --> 12:23.416
I can't.

12:26.127 --> 12:27.503
What's wrong with you?

12:27.629 --> 12:29.172
If this was the real deal,

12:29.255 --> 12:31.090
you'd be shot full of lightning right now.

12:31.215 --> 12:33.551
I'm sorry, but it just didn't feel right.

12:34.302 --> 12:35.720
I didn't feel like myself.

12:38.473 --> 12:39.557
( WATERMELON SPLATTERS )

12:39.682 --> 12:41.517
There! That's how it's done.

12:42.936 --> 12:44.437
( NIBBLING )

12:54.948 --> 12:56.908
I have a surprise for everyone!

12:57.283 --> 13:00.119
I knew it! You did have
a secret thing with Haru!

13:02.455 --> 13:04.332
Uh... No.

13:04.457 --> 13:08.002
I was looking for cooking pots
in the attic and I found this.

13:09.462 --> 13:12.382
Look at baby Zuko! Isn't he cute?

13:12.507 --> 13:15.551
ALL EXCEPT ZUKO: ( LAUGHING )

13:15.677 --> 13:17.553
Oh, lighten up. I'm just teasing.

13:18.054 --> 13:21.099
That's not me. It's my father.

13:22.725 --> 13:24.811
But he looks so sweet and innocent.

13:24.936 --> 13:27.689
Well, that sweet little kid
grew up to be a monster.

13:27.814 --> 13:30.149
And the worst father
in the history of fathers.

13:30.274 --> 13:32.610
AANG: But he's still a human being.

13:33.069 --> 13:34.612
You're going to defend him?

13:34.696 --> 13:36.447
No, I agree with you.

13:36.572 --> 13:38.574
Fire Lord Ozai is a horrible person,

13:38.700 --> 13:40.743
and the world will probably
be better off without him,

13:40.868 --> 13:42.578
but there's gotta be another way.

13:42.704 --> 13:43.997
ZUKO: Like what?

13:44.122 --> 13:45.289
I don't know.

13:45.456 --> 13:47.792
Maybe we can make some big pots of glue

13:47.875 --> 13:49.127
and then I can use gluebending

13:49.252 --> 13:50.545
to stick his arms and legs together

13:50.670 --> 13:52.130
so he can't bend anymore.

13:52.505 --> 13:54.173
Yeah, then you can show
him his baby pictures

13:54.298 --> 13:56.300
and all those happy memories
will make him good again.

13:56.426 --> 13:58.052
Do you really think that would work?

13:58.428 --> 14:00.263
- No!
-( SIGHS HEAVILY )

14:01.973 --> 14:04.809
This goes against everything
I learned from the monks.

14:04.934 --> 14:07.645
I can't just go around
wiping out people I don't like.

14:07.770 --> 14:10.064
Sure, you can. You're the Avatar.

14:10.189 --> 14:11.733
If it's in the name of keeping balance,

14:11.858 --> 14:14.152
I'm pretty sure the universe
will forgive you.

14:14.569 --> 14:16.529
This isn't a joke, Sokka!

14:16.654 --> 14:18.906
None of you understand
the position I'm in!

14:19.032 --> 14:21.284
Aang, we do understand. It's just―

14:21.367 --> 14:23.077
Just what, Katara, what?

14:23.161 --> 14:24.954
We're trying to help.

14:25.079 --> 14:27.290
When you figure out a way
for me to beat the Fire Lord

14:27.415 --> 14:29.917
without taking his life,
I'd love to hear it!

14:31.544 --> 14:33.796
Aang, don't walk away from this.

14:35.006 --> 14:37.425
Let him go.

14:37.550 --> 14:40.011
He needs time to sort it out by himself.

14:55.401 --> 14:57.153
( CHATTERING )

14:57.278 --> 14:58.613
Hey, Momo.

14:58.738 --> 15:00.823
I don't suppose you know what I should do.

15:01.199 --> 15:02.450
( SQUAWKS )

15:02.575 --> 15:03.868
I didn't think so.

15:18.508 --> 15:21.719
MEN: ( DEEP-TONED HYPNOTIC CHANTING )

15:37.026 --> 15:39.362
( HYPNOTIC CHANT CONTINUES )

16:03.845 --> 16:05.054
SOKKA: Okay, that's everything.

16:05.179 --> 16:07.807
No, it's not. Where's Aang?

16:12.353 --> 16:14.897
Aang? Aang?

16:15.022 --> 16:16.899
Come on, lazy bones, let's go!

16:18.776 --> 16:20.153
( DOOR CREAKS, THUDS )

16:30.830 --> 16:32.415
He left his staff.

16:32.540 --> 16:33.708
That's so strange.

16:33.833 --> 16:35.877
Aang's not in a house.
Let's check the beach.

16:39.005 --> 16:41.465
SOKKA: Look! There's his footprints.

16:41.591 --> 16:43.092
The trail ends here.

16:43.551 --> 16:46.721
So, he went for a midnight
swim and never came back?

16:46.846 --> 16:48.347
Maybe he was captured.

16:48.472 --> 16:50.808
I don't think so.
There's no sign of a struggle.

16:50.933 --> 16:52.602
I bet he ran away again.

16:52.727 --> 16:55.313
Uh-uh. He left behind his glider and Appa.

16:55.438 --> 16:56.898
Then what do you think

16:57.023 --> 16:58.482
happened to him, oh, sleuthy one?

16:59.192 --> 17:01.068
It's pretty obvious.

17:01.194 --> 17:03.487
Aang mysteriously disappears
before an important battle?

17:03.779 --> 17:06.282
He's definitely on a Spirit World journey.

17:06.407 --> 17:09.160
But if he was,
wouldn't his body still be here?

17:09.285 --> 17:11.037
Oh, yeah, I forgot about that.

17:11.162 --> 17:13.039
KATARA: Then he's gotta be
somewhere on Ember Island.

17:13.164 --> 17:14.707
Let's split up and look for him.

17:14.957 --> 17:16.584
I'm going with Zuko!

17:16.667 --> 17:18.211
What?

17:18.336 --> 17:20.880
Everyone else went on
a life-changing field-trip with Zuko.

17:20.963 --> 17:22.173
Now, it's my turn.

17:30.181 --> 17:32.475
CROWD: ( CHANTING ) Aang! Aang!

17:36.062 --> 17:37.855
( CHANTING CONTINUES )

17:39.732 --> 17:42.318
- Avatar State, yip-yip!
- CROWD: ( CHEERING )

17:42.401 --> 17:44.153
BOTH: ( GROWLING )

17:44.445 --> 17:47.156
TOPH: And then when I was
nine, I ran away again.

17:47.281 --> 17:49.408
- Uh-huh.
- I know I shouldn't complain.

17:49.533 --> 17:52.036
My parents gave me
everything I ever asked for.

17:52.161 --> 17:55.081
But they never gave the one
thing that I really wanted...

17:55.206 --> 17:57.166
Their love, you know what I mean?

17:57.250 --> 17:58.542
( GROANS )

17:58.668 --> 18:00.795
Look, I know you had a rough childhood.

18:00.920 --> 18:04.131
But we should really
focus on finding Aang.

18:04.674 --> 18:06.926
This is the worst field-trip ever.

18:07.051 --> 18:08.636
( BLOWS )

18:14.600 --> 18:15.893
Judging by the looks on your faces,

18:16.018 --> 18:18.271
I'm guessing you guys
didn't find Aang, either.

18:19.563 --> 18:21.357
No.

18:21.482 --> 18:23.943
It's like he just disappeared.

18:24.068 --> 18:25.528
Hey, wait a minute.

18:25.653 --> 18:27.738
Has anyone noticed that
Momo is missing, too?

18:27.863 --> 18:31.867
Oh, no! I knew it
was only a matter of time!

18:32.868 --> 18:35.121
Appa ate Momo!

18:35.329 --> 18:37.707
Momo, I'm coming for you, buddy!

18:37.999 --> 18:41.585
Sokka, Appa didn't eat Momo.
He's probably with Aang.

18:42.086 --> 18:45.172
That's just what Appa wants you to think.

18:45.464 --> 18:47.466
ZUKO: Get out of the bison's mouth, Sokka.

18:47.591 --> 18:49.260
We have a real problem here.

18:49.385 --> 18:52.430
Aang is nowhere to be found and
the comet is only two days away.

18:52.555 --> 18:54.890
What should we do, Zuko?

18:55.391 --> 18:56.809
I don't know.

18:59.854 --> 19:01.480
Why are you all looking at me?

19:01.689 --> 19:04.442
Well, you are kind of
the expert on tracking Aang.

19:04.567 --> 19:08.612
Yeah, if anyone's got experience
hunting the Avatar, it's you.

19:13.451 --> 19:15.578
Zuko, I don't wanna tell
you how to do your job,

19:15.703 --> 19:17.747
but why we are heading
towards the Earth Kingdom?

19:18.164 --> 19:19.749
There's no way Aang's there.

19:19.874 --> 19:21.584
Just trust me.

19:41.145 --> 19:43.147
Come on, slowpokes, faster!

20:04.794 --> 20:06.379
Sorry I'm late, Father.

20:06.504 --> 20:10.091
Good palanquin bearers are
so hard to come by these days.

20:10.216 --> 20:12.760
So, is everything ready for our departure?

20:12.885 --> 20:15.096
There has been a change of plans, Azula.

20:15.221 --> 20:16.222
What?

20:16.305 --> 20:20.351
I've decided to lead the fleet
of airships to Ba Sing Se alone.

20:20.643 --> 20:23.771
You will remain here in the Fire Nation.

20:24.105 --> 20:26.690
But, I thought we were
going to do this together.

20:27.024 --> 20:29.443
My decision is final.

20:30.236 --> 20:32.780
You... You can't treat me like this!

20:32.905 --> 20:34.740
You can't treat me like Zuko!

20:34.865 --> 20:37.368
Azula, silence yourself.

20:37.493 --> 20:39.995
But it was my idea to burn
everything to the ground.

20:40.121 --> 20:41.914
I deserve to be by your side!

20:42.039 --> 20:44.750
Azula!

20:44.875 --> 20:46.127
Listen to me.

20:46.252 --> 20:49.130
I need you here
to watch over the homeland.

20:49.255 --> 20:53.801
It's a very important job that
I can only entrust to you.

20:53.926 --> 20:55.302
Really?

20:55.428 --> 20:57.555
And for your loyalty,

20:57.680 --> 21:01.350
I've decided to declare you
the new Fire Lord.

21:02.143 --> 21:04.186
Fire Lord Azula?

21:04.311 --> 21:06.981
It does seems appropriate.

21:07.106 --> 21:08.566
But, what about you?

21:08.858 --> 21:12.194
Fire Lord Ozai is no more.

21:12.319 --> 21:15.364
Just as the world will be reborn in fire,

21:15.489 --> 21:19.994
I shall be reborn
as the supreme ruler of the world.

21:20.119 --> 21:23.747
From this moment on, I will be known as...

21:23.873 --> 21:25.833
The Phoenix King!

21:38.012 --> 21:39.597
( FLAMES ROARING )

21:53.152 --> 21:55.654
TAVERN PATRONS: ( SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY )

21:57.907 --> 21:59.158
And the reason you brought us

21:59.283 --> 22:01.535
to a seedy Earth Kingdom tavern
is what now?

22:01.660 --> 22:02.828
June.

22:04.830 --> 22:06.415
MAN: ( GROANS )

22:06.916 --> 22:08.709
SOKKA: Oh, yeah, that weird bounty hunter

22:08.834 --> 22:10.419
with the giant mole.

22:10.544 --> 22:12.505
KATARA: Mole? Her skin is flawless.

22:12.630 --> 22:14.006
SOKKA: No, she has this
giant mole-creature

22:14.131 --> 22:15.591
she rides around on.

22:15.799 --> 22:16.967
The Shirshu.

22:17.092 --> 22:18.886
It's the only animal that
can track Aang's scent

22:19.011 --> 22:20.554
anywhere in the world.

22:20.679 --> 22:22.515
It's the one shot we have of finding him.

22:22.848 --> 22:24.517
MAN: ( GRUNTING )

22:35.319 --> 22:39.114
I don't know who this
June lady is, but I like her.

22:40.366 --> 22:43.410
MOMO: ( PURRING )

22:43.744 --> 22:46.080
( GROANS )

22:46.205 --> 22:49.458
Hey, Momo. I just had the strangest dream.

22:52.545 --> 22:54.630
Wait!

23:03.722 --> 23:05.182
AANG: Where are we?

23:14.333 --> 23:16.335
( CLOSING THEME PLAYING )
